21:08:49 [fd1f] --- TAKEAWAYS / LESSONS ---
21:08:49 [fd1f] The story MUST teach 2–3 clear takeaways that the child can articulate after listening. Demonstrate them through what characters DO and the consequences they face — do NOT preach or moralise inside the narration. After the story ends, list the takeaways explicitly in a ** Takeaways ** section.
