21:14:10 [0368] Set the story in a school, classroom, or playground.
21:14:10 [0368] The obstacle should involve a social or learning challenge (new routine, group activity, lost item).
21:14:10 [0368] The resolution should show that asking for help and cooperating leads to success.
21:14:10 [0368] 
