21:19:26 [890f] Set the story outdoors with vivid seasonal details (falling leaves, snow, blooming flowers, warm sun).
21:19:26 [890f] The obstacle should involve a change in weather or nature that the protagonist must adapt to.
21:19:26 [890f] The resolution should connect seasonal change to personal growth or emotional understanding.
