21:19:26 [890f] 2. MIDDLE: ethan encounters an obstacle. ethan meets a supportive character who helps. Show the process of overcoming the challenge together.
21:19:26 [890f] 3. END: ethan achieves the goal, learns something, and feels positive about the experience.
